From 33ade8c7e17d0516ce34b2c6955d0547f87e51c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:04:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 29/59] Deliver only the keys of the application keyset

Applications got every key, also keys they didn't request with
keyset.setValue(). On a TV such keys are handled by the TV itself,
e.g. the numeric keys switch the channel. Mirror the keyset into the
browser process and let ProcessKey() return false for keys which are
not in the keyset.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
---
